            "download_url": "https://www.blenderkit.com/api/v1/downloads/134955/",
            "tooltip": "Sofa Faux velvet Upholstered 3-Seater\n\nElegant and stylish, this three-seater\n sofa will transform any living room\n into a luxurious lounge. Featuring\n soft tufting details, this sofa\n injects multifaceted texture into your\n overall design scheme. Faux leather\n upholstery and seating padding with\n high-density foam add maximum comfort\n for you when lounging after a long day\n. Come with the solid wood frame and\n gold stainless steel base, this sofa\n delivers sturdy support and durable\n performance. Lend a touch of luxury in\n your living room with this sofa.\n\nsize: 2.15m, 0.73m, 0.7m\nface count: 116546, render: 149810\nfiles size: 27MB 212KB\ntexture resolution: 2048\nlicense: royalty_free\n",
