            "tooltip": "Bowery Hill 30 cm Square Leather Ottoman\n\nAdd a touch of glam to your home with\n the Bowery Hill ottoman. The solid and\n engineered wood construction makes\n this ottoman a sturdy yet compact\n addition to your living room, entryway\n, bedroom, or any shared space. The\n modern and contemporary-inspired\n ottoman features black faux leather\n upholstery and foam padding. The\n button-tufting with faux crystal\n details of this ottoman can give your\n space a little bit of the luxe and\n glam look to complete the style you\n want. The ottoman is chic, compact,\n and comes fully assembled.\n\nsize: 0.35m, 0.35m, 0.35m\nface count: 112384, render: 112384\nfiles size: 21MB 41KB\ntexture resolution: 2048\nlicense: royalty_free\n",
