            "tooltip": "Hand Painted Teal Tiles\n\nThey are hand painted tiles, so brush\n strokes and defects can easily be\n spotted. The teal color makes these\n tiles evergreen for kitchens and\n bathrooms. Instead of paving\n traditional porcelain tiles, this\n handmade tiles grant the house\n interior a contemporary appearance.\n\nfiles size: 6MB 378KB\ntexture size: 1.0m\ntexture resolution: 4096\nlicense: royalty_free\n",
