              "name": "Sofa Faux velvet Upholstered 3-Seater",
              "displayName": "Sofa Faux velvet Upholstered 3-Seater",
              "description": "Elegant and stylish, this three-seater sofa will transform any living room into a luxurious lounge. Featuring soft tufting details, this sofa injects multifaceted texture into your overall design scheme. Faux leather upholstery and seating padding with high-density foam add maximum comfort for you when lounging after a long day. Come with the solid wood frame and gold stainless steel base, this sofa delivers sturdy support and durable performance. Lend a touch of luxury in your living room with this sofa.",
