              "name": "Bowery Hill 30 cm Square Leather Ottoman",
              "displayName": "Bowery Hill 30 cm Square Leather Ottoman",
              "description": "Add a touch of glam to your home with the Bowery Hill ottoman. The solid and engineered wood construction makes this ottoman a sturdy yet compact addition to your living room, entryway, bedroom, or any shared space. The modern and contemporary-inspired ottoman features black faux leather upholstery and foam padding. The button-tufting with faux crystal details of this ottoman can give your space a little bit of the luxe and glam look to complete the style you want. The ottoman is chic, compact, and comes fully assembled.",
